Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 17:50:39 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Diplomacy: trade values from effects, offers by value
 (AI_DIPLOMACY_FLAGS)

The AI drew every offer at random, priced techs without its research
modifier, valued resources by fixed weights blind to its cities and
could trade its whole treasury. AI_DIPLOMACY_FLAGS (default 15, 0 is
the old AI): 1 a tech's value is its remaining research at the
receiver's own research rate; 2 a resource's value is its effect in
the valuer's own cities (happiness and health where needed, building
yield bonuses such as Town Essentials with Coffee or a Forge with Gold
on the cities' real yields, plus what it unlocks), and a new deal must
cover the AI's own loss; 4 offers ask for what is worth most to the AI
and give what is worth least, no tech sold to a higher-ranked team;
8 tech purchases the AI proposes keep its gold target.

Serves: P18, P19
